# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240029> (cement)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240029> "Cement is a portion of matter that is made from limestone and clay; other elements may be present. It is used as a building material to set as a solid mass or is used as an ingredient in making mortar or concrete. It has a solid normal state of matter. It is the physical output of an industrial process and has a commodity role."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00240029> "Zement"@de)
