# Class: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410009> (legislation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410009> "A legislation is a plan specification that is produced by a government and enables, prohibits or bans activities, or establishes rights or responsibilities."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00410009> "Definition partly adapted from https://addictovocab.org/ADDICTO_0000488")
