Emissions and removals from arable and tillage land, rice fields, and agro-forestry systems where vegetation falls below the thresholds used for the forest land category.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010190> "2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/")
