# Individual: <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019> (medium uncertainty)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019> "Medium uncertainty is a level of model uncertainty at which one can enumerate multiple alternatives and rank them in order of perceived likelihood, without being able to discern how intensely the likelihood varies between two alternatives.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019> "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019> "medium uncertainty"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1945")
ClassAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400017> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00400019>)

